# Invisible-Unicode pre-commit plugin (CVE-2021-42574 -- Trojan Source):
# scripts/lint-unicode.sh --scope=staged. Run by .githooks/pre-commit through
# the run-parts-style runner. Policy and implementation live in the script,
# which materializes the staged BLOBS with `git checkout-index` and scans
# those -- the index content a commit actually records, not the possibly
# dirty working-tree copy at the same path. The same script serves the other
# scopes: the lint-unicode CI job runs --scope=tracked, the audit runs
# --scope=tree.
#
# This plugin once carried its own grep detector so the hook had no
# dependency on scripts/. That bought a second codepoint table to keep in
# sync and a weaker gate at exactly the layer closest to the attack: the
# script's python3 path covers all of Unicode categories Cf and Cc plus
# UTF-8-without-BOM enforcement, where the grep table covered sixteen
# codepoints. The script's own POSIX-sh fallback (the same sixteen) is the
# floor where python3 is absent, so the old behavior is the worst case
# rather than the only case. Unified 2026-07-29; rationale and history in
# ADR 0006:
# https://github.com/toobuntu/repo-foundation/blob/main/docs/decisions/0006-trojan-source-detection-strategy.md
#
# Missing script = hard error, not warn-and-skip (the 80-perms stance): a
# security gate fails closed. The git_hooks sync set relies on scripts_core
# for exactly this file pair.
#
# Universal: mastered at this natural path -- repo-foundation runs it on its
# own commits (ADR 0001) -- and synced to every hook-carrying consumer
# (git_hooks in sync-manifest.yaml). Run-parts classicalre name (no
# extension); disable with a dot suffix (80-unicode.off). In the 80- verifier
# tier, which runs after the tiers that restage files.

set -e

if [ ! -x scripts/lint-unicode.sh ]; then
  printf 'error: scripts/lint-unicode.sh missing or not executable; the\n' >&2
  printf '  invisible-Unicode gate cannot run, so the commit is refused.\n' >&2
  printf '  Fix: sync scripts_core (scripts/lint-unicode.sh + .py), or\n' >&2
  printf '       chmod 755 scripts/lint-unicode.sh\n' >&2
  exit 1
fi

exec scripts/lint-unicode.sh --scope=staged
